MoEForCausalLM has generative capabilities, as `prepare_inputs_for_generation` is explicitly defined. However, it doesn't directly inherit from `GenerationMixin`. From 👉v4.50👈 onwards, `PreTrainedModel` will NOT inherit from `GenerationMixin`, and this model will lose the ability to call `generate` and other related functions.
